{"id":"vod_sn_38662","vodId":"38662","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"玻璃之唇","name_cn":"玻璃之唇","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1930bd2f92b71b6151c5329a8560d35a.jpg"},"summary":"深水透子（深川芹亚 配音）是一位看似平凡的高中三年级学生，因为家中经营着一间玻璃工厂，所以，可以反射影像的玻璃在透子的生活中随处可见。从很小的时候，透子便发现自己拥有一些神奇的能力，可以从玻璃的反射中看到莫名的影像，只是透子并不知道这些影像究竟代表了什么。　　某一天，一位名叫冲仓驱（逢坂良太 配音）的转学生出现在了透子的身边，驱告诉透子，自己和她有着相同的经历，只是透子看到的是影像，而他则能够听到声响，这些影像和声响结合起来，便成为了能够预示未来的残片。当发现未来并不如想象中那样美好之时，透子和驱会做出怎样的选择呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:03:30","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Tg2AWLGzwN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qEfD9YyQhN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Qcivh4v7zm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/38C8ZcRhe51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/w3WWYw8NEf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vyNmTWYBgh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XQFaiSKxy31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7z1m20kfhj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EfAE6v41dr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KXz37xDGtq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/f1Qks6F1yw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uvGAn1j6aJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/u4mN7jZY3G1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:56.251Z"}